  "content": "<p><strong>InsaneCraft v1.3.1 是最後一個官方 InsaneCraft 模組包的更新版本。我們將不再提供任何後續更新或錯誤修復，並且<u>不再支援 InsaneCraft</u>。感謝大家一直以來對這個模組包的關注與喜愛！&lt;3<br><br>遊玩者：SSundee、Sigils、Henwy、BiffleWiffle 以及 JeromeASF。</strong></p><p>+ 250 個瘋狂模組<br>+ 內含遺失的無限模組&nbsp;<br>+ 官方模組包<br>+ 經典與全新模組<br>+ 免費世界託管！（Essential Mod）</p><p>終極挑戰：收集無限寶石，成為薩諾斯。</p><p>建議記憶體：<br>- 6GB（低階）<br>- 8GB（較佳）<br>- 16GB（高階）</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/527180/description_e4cb3795-16f6-4bad-a2a2-408e3ae8caf4.jpg\"><br></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/suENVN_n3rw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></em></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8gLD6S73riI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p>模組列表（點擊名稱可前往該模組頁面）：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-pixel-the-betweenlands-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵之地（Betweenlands）(MrCompost)<br></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵國度（AbyssalCraft）(Shinoow)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵國度整合（AbyssalCraft Integrations）(Shinoow)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alchemistry\" rel=\"nofollow\">化學（Alchemistry）(al132)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">環境音效4（AmbientSounds 4）(CreativeMD)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-spellcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">遠古法術（Ancient Spellcraft）(windanesz)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/base\" rel=\"nofollow\">B.A.S.E (lanse505)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bad-wither-no-cookie-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">壞凋靈不給餅乾重製版（BadWitherNoCookieReloaded）(Kreezxil)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bewitchment-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">巫術傳承（Bewitchment-Legacy）(sunconure11)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物魔法（Botania）(Vazkii)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brandons-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brandon核心（Brandon's Core）(brandon3055)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buildcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">建築工業（Buildcraft）(Covert_Jaguar)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carry-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">搬運（Carry On）(Tschipp)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/champions\" rel=\"nofollow\">精英怪（Champions）(TheIllusiveC4)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunkpregenerator\" rel=\"nofollow\">區塊預生成器（Chunk-Pregenerator）(Speiger)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-tombstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">珊瑚墓碑（Corail Tombstone）(Corail_31)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成修改器（CraftTweaker）(Jaredlll08)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">創意核心（CreativeCore）(CreativeMD)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" rel=\"nofollow\">循環（Cyclic）(